    kind: invariant  # 0690
    title: "the rust.py/rust_scip.py stable_id parity holds for 0 of 52 overlapping symbols on production input, and its test feeds tree-sitter spans back to itself so it cannot fail"  # 0690
    status: violated  # 0690
    priority: 2  # 0690
    parent:  # 0690
    tags:  # 0690
